 ## Operating characteristics
-*   **Time Complexity:** Not given in the sources.
-*   **Memory Complexity:** Not given in the sources.
-*   **Strengths:** Fast, interactive frame rates possible, especially with hardware acceleration (e.g., OpenGL color matrix for dot products) [S3]. Simple to implement.
-*   **Limitations:** Limited to opaque surfaces (thresholded). Restricted to single light source in some hardware implementations [S3].
-*   **When to use:** Useful for visualizing bone or other tissues for medical purposes [S1, unofficial].
